WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.360
Start with one campaign, and build a foundation that can grow.

2
00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:16.140
Connect the brief, product facts, asset library and approvals. Let each specialist agent contribute one clear output, while the team keeps creative control.

3
00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:27.490
Measure the impact in practical terms: time saved, useful creative produced, customer journeys completed, and learning carried into the next campaign.

4
00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:39.765
Then expand what works: from one content queue to more campaigns, from one styling journey to more products, and from one approved master to more channels and screens.

5
00:00:39.765 --> 00:00:47.440
Eight connected opportunities. Start with one campaign, measure quality and human effort, then expand what works.
